# ============================================================
#  GAVA Recruitment CRM — Environment Variables
#  Copy this file to ".env" and fill in your values.
#  Never share the .env file with anyone.
# ============================================================

# ── Google Places API (REQUIRED — finds businesses on the map) ───────────────
# Monthly cost: $0 — Google gives $200 free credit/month, which covers
# roughly 11,000 business searches. More than enough.
#
# How to get it (5 minutes):
#   1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com
#   2. Sign in with your Google account → click "Create Project"
#   3. Name it "GAVA" → click Create
#   4. In the search bar at the top, type "Places API" → click it → click Enable
#   5. Click "Credentials" in the left menu → "+ Create Credentials" → API Key
#   6. Copy the key and paste it below
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=your_google_places_api_key_here

# ── Hunter.io API (OPTIONAL — finds HR email contacts at companies) ───────────
# Without this key: the app scans company websites for emails for free (slower).
# With this key: Hunter.io gives you verified email addresses + contact names.
#
# Free tier : 25 searches/month → good for testing
# Starter   : $49/month for 500 searches → enough for active daily outreach
#
# How to get it (2 minutes):
#   1. Go to https://hunter.io and create a free account
#   2. Click your name (top right) → API
#   3. Copy your API key and paste it below
#   Leave blank to use free website scanning instead.
HUNTER_API_KEY=your_hunter_api_key_here

# ── Anthropic / Claude API (REQUIRED — writes your outreach emails) ──────────
# Cost: pay-as-you-go, roughly $0.01–0.03 per email draft. Very cheap.
# With normal use you'll spend less than $2/month.
#
# How to get it (3 minutes):
#   1. Go to https://console.anthropic.com
#   2. Sign up → click "Get API Keys" → "+ Create Key"
#   3. Copy the key and paste it below
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here

# ── Gmail (REQUIRED — sends emails from inside the app) ──────────────────────
# Use your full Gmail address
GMAIL_ADDRESS=yourname@gmail.com
#
# Use an App Password — NOT your regular Gmail password.
# How to create one (3 minutes):
#   1. Go to https://myaccount.google.com/security
#   2. Make sure "2-Step Verification" is ON (turn it on if not)
#   3. In the search bar on that page, search "App passwords"
#   4. Select App = "Mail", Device = "Windows Computer" → click Generate
#   5. A 16-character password appears — copy it here (no spaces)
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your_16_char_app_password
